<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Europe</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Europe</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-eu</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:07:32Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-eu" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-1433?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-eu" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Divisions deepen between EU member states after tense budget summit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2be9010adb4f82fe958faa15c65c6b8a197a1221455c4a57759724b4a3014bd1</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-27T16:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/divisions-deepen-between-eu-member-states-after-tense-budget-summit/a-80078599--05a844bfc611.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/divisions-deepen-between-eu-member-states-after-tense-budget-summit/a-80078599?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">An EU leaders summit on the bloc's seven-year budget fell apart amid divisions over how to fund Ukraine. The budget proposal also includes a 3% tax on US tech companies, in a bid for the EU to generate additional funds.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Dutch authorities seize 26 critically endangered turtles from luggage of passenger bound for Hong Kong</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c8674061a8e692f3193cf426e4d8212fa808ae9c1bcfd262a39aabcd831089a7</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-27T15:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/dutch-authorities-seize-26-critically-endangered-turtles-from-luggage-of-passenger-bound-for-hong-ko/a-80077824--bdef9f0677e0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/dutch-authorities-seize-26-critically-endangered-turtles-from-luggage-of-passenger-bound-for-hong-kong/a-80077824?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The tiny Vallarta mud turtle was only discovered in 2018. It's critically endangered with around 300 thought to live in the wild. Almost one tenth of that number were stashed in a traveler's luggage, bound in duct tape.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Airline Norse Atlantic files for bankruptcy, succumbing to aviation fuel costs</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fefc71a06b5d3e056067018f07b41b35e0eb8f9697ab55344baa3ab9c82132a3</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-27T14:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/airline-norse-atlantic-files-for-bankruptcy-succumbing-to-aviation-fuel-costs/a-80076728--deb84ffc1870.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/airline-norse-atlantic-files-for-bankruptcy-succumbing-to-aviation-fuel-costs/a-80076728?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The low-cost airline was only founded a few years ago and had been struggling to turn a profit. The spike in aviation fuel prices caused by the war in Iran has now driven Norway's Norse Atlantic into bankruptcy.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Informer TV owner Vucicevic arrested: Has the reckoning with Serbia's pro-Vucic media machine begun?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:babf7b78166891adfb05864dc25db8c71979f5cbac30ea3faf0277a645b530cb</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:07:26Z</updated><published>2026-11-27T13:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/informer-tv-owner-vucicevic-arrested-has-the-reckoning-with-serbia-s-pro-vucic-media-machine-begun/a-80074650--983ff7ae64ee.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/informer-tv-owner-vucicevic-arrested-has-the-reckoning-with-serbia-s-pro-vucic-media-machine-begun/a-80074650?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The arrest of media owner Dragan J. Vucicevic raises questions about whether Serbia is holding the people behind the country's pro-Vucic media accountable — or whether this is another political power struggle.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Albania's youth are protesting, no longer leaving the country</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:426f6241803dfc119b4a29843e05c0d9f3d1eb7fe91983f0a52e69c4fd1fccc8</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T20:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/albania-s-youth-are-protesting-no-longer-leaving-the-country/a-80068939--19bf6b73472f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/albania-s-youth-are-protesting-no-longer-leaving-the-country/a-80068939?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Youth protests against a rigid political system and corruption have shaken the government of Albanian Prime Minister Edi Rama. They also show that fewer young people are willing to emigrate in search of a better future.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>FIFA says a cyberattack against it targeted a 'limited set of personal and business information'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:10850b1c952802221cdc279137ec71decf483518830756ced2094135a11f45ec</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T14:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fifa-says-a-cyberattack-against-it-targeted-a-limited-set-of-personal-and-business-information/a-80062660--002158da7f55.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fifa-says-a-cyberattack-against-it-targeted-a-limited-set-of-personal-and-business-information/a-80062660?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">World football's governing body says the cyberattack targeted personal and business information. They struck at a sensitive time for the under-fire organization and its president, Gianni Infantino.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Crew member dies after diesel tanker sinks off Ibiza coast</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:285f684d4b5f715aa6660bc4e1b93b02d76668d811c645135c9e3fc33717c5b9</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T11:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/crew-member-dies-after-diesel-tanker-sinks-off-ibiza-coast/a-80059054--ee7eaa5aee4e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/crew-member-dies-after-diesel-tanker-sinks-off-ibiza-coast/a-80059054?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Authorities rescued 17 crew members but one later died in hospital after a diesel tanker capsized off the Spanish island of Ibiza. A contingency plan against possible pollution damage is now in place.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russia-Ukraine war extends to Baltic, Mediterranean</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e312d3a41b3287a265889a9fa88797d39206fd85bccb518be81f132182d3dda6</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:07:32Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T09:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-ukraine-war-extends-to-baltic-mediterranean/a-80054604--b6459954c1cd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-ukraine-war-extends-to-baltic-mediterranean/a-80054604?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">By attacking Russian vessels around the world, Ukraine is trying to increase the pressure on Russia and also sending out signals to its Western allies. What is the impact on global maritime trade?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Can Rassvet, 'Russia's Starlink' change the course of the war in Ukraine?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:959c6fed7ad2a1dff7b06fc76dbc0b6305e062337b5391350b0c79f6f54c0d53</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T05:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-rassvet-russia-s-starlink-change-the-course-of-the-war-in-ukraine/a-80052579--622ab8b1bc5d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-rassvet-russia-s-starlink-change-the-course-of-the-war-in-ukraine/a-80052579?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">SpaceX's US Starlink satellite system has played a key role in countering the Russian military in Ukraine, but now a Russian counterpart is under development. What could this mean for Ukraine?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Peter Magyar meets Volodymyr Zelenskyy: Hungary and Ukraine make a fresh start after the icy relations of the Viktor Orban era</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:903d932fd25f7cd4b81d963a9a1d42053e9512fa416771ee0ec34cd49c2c8614</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T18:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/peter-magyar-meets-volodymyr-zelenskyy-hungary-and-ukraine-make-a-fresh-start-after-the-icy-relation/a-80054175--5597adb6deec.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/peter-magyar-meets-volodymyr-zelenskyy-hungary-and-ukraine-make-a-fresh-start-after-the-icy-relations-of-the-viktor-orban-era/a-80054175?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After years of frosty and hostile relations under Hungary's Kremlin-friendly former PM Viktor Orban, his successor, Peter Magyar, and Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy seek to reset their countries' ties.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine's bid for NATO membership and more air defense remains controversial</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:938570d904ba11c6aa652ccb94094092bf31e67f1ab7aa6fd411aa5a88ff47c6</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T16:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-s-bid-for-nato-membership-and-more-air-defense-remains-controversial/a-80029852--1abf02560b4b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-s-bid-for-nato-membership-and-more-air-defense-remains-controversial/a-80029852?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy is calling for the rapid acceptance of his country into NATO. However, the necessary unanimity for this is lacking, as shown during the NATO Parliamentary Assembly in Berlin.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>EU enlargement: Why do some EU member states use their vetoes to block the accession of certain candidate countries?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:759629e809550c7b4665b6933a932d44a62e38f956cbfd3d2c7abd62041d0cf6</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T14:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-enlargement-why-do-some-eu-member-states-use-their-vetoes-to-block-the-accession-of-certain-candi/a-80034401--27cd622204d3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-enlargement-why-do-some-eu-member-states-use-their-vetoes-to-block-the-accession-of-certain-candidate-countries/a-80034401?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Individual EU member states use their veto powers to block candidate countries in the accession process — often for reasons of domestic politics. DW takes a look at some cases and examines what's behind them.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>North Macedonia remains stalled on its EU path after 21 years as a candidate</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:20a23bcccce93f53e3b03368056210a62f46af5caa1da862f2344076ce493b6b</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T13:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-macedonia-remains-stalled-on-its-eu-path-after-21-years-as-a-candidate/a-80020841--291e539f1390.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-macedonia-remains-stalled-on-its-eu-path-after-21-years-as-a-candidate/a-80020841?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">EU enlargement has regained momentum, with Montenegro and Albania moving closer to membership. But North Macedonia, a candidate since 2005, remains stalled by a politically difficult dispute involving Bulgaria.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>German police respond to multiple school bomb threats</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4f1fab8589ed177003a526d7c9621d4e93492fb2748c99fb3d4a0fed733eb7f4</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T11:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-police-respond-to-multiple-school-bomb-threats/a-80018842--56ba1301d92a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-police-respond-to-multiple-school-bomb-threats/a-80018842?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Police in Germany are responding to bomb threats against a series of schools, but say that at present they don't believe them to be credible. Danish authorities are reporting a similar series of apparent hoaxes.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russian helicopter suspected of violating Finnish airspace</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:14bb147736dad0c076f157c1539bedb328f045def70c77c3f5fdb645dc5178aa</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T17:08:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russian-helicopter-suspected-of-violating-finnish-airspace/a-80010133--74b233a91706.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russian-helicopter-suspected-of-violating-finnish-airspace/a-80010133?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Finland's Defense Ministry thinks the incursion is linked to a drone strike earlier Saturday on a Russian cargo ship, which is on a US sanctions list.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU and Indonesia sign trade deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4a1bc5ad3c6f41ea2ba1a6c1640b0c1adb2583754c3d59f6df8adac6d8fb93a4</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T15:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-and-indonesia-sign-trade-deal/a-80010099--bb068ad239d4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-and-indonesia-sign-trade-deal/a-80010099?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A deal covering 730 million people promises lower tariffs and new investment opportunities as the European Union seeks to diversify trade ties amid growing global economic tensions.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>EU takes aim at tech giants in tax proposal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d90e7c311c54695d4afd91609daa13303f6a642370f0ff34f037c84f1b9fb62d</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T14:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-takes-aim-at-tech-giants-in-tax-proposal/a-80009255--1b2179c47506.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-takes-aim-at-tech-giants-in-tax-proposal/a-80009255?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">European Council President Antonio Costa has proposed a smaller EU budget for 2028-2034, including a 3% tax on major digital firms to ease member states' contributions. France has already rejected the plan as inadequate.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Russia strikes Zelenskyy's hometown, killing 2</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:251a7d7b5c257237af32e2dcca34efd95e82de76c99dc96108c0b81d43c6c5dc</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T14:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-strikes-zelenskyy-s-hometown-killing-2/a-80009458--1c5b88d83c35.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-strikes-zelenskyy-s-hometown-killing-2/a-80009458?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The attacks follow Russian President Vladimir Putin's vow of a "painful" response to Ukraine's attacks this week on the Kerch Bridge, linking Russian-occupied Crimea.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russian ornithologist jailed over small donations to Navalny's foundation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c39e259b769dd99c2a3c0291d666a14494a32137a0f2d72ce40fb16668022dab</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T20:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russian-ornithologist-jailed-over-small-donations-to-navalny-s-foundation/a-80005505--49dba4e1f94e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russian-ornithologist-jailed-over-small-donations-to-navalny-s-foundation/a-80005505?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Sofia Rosenfeld has devoted her life to studying Arctic birds. A Russian court sentenced her to 3.5 years in a penal colony over donations to Navalny's foundation. Friends and family are fighting for her release.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>EU and UK strike 'landmark deal' to strengthen ties after Brexit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:738f77cda6b149beea1bbf79b44b1a1ca602726076587ce51880c58571912f0e</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T14:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-and-uk-strike-landmark-deal-to-strengthen-ties-after-brexit/a-80001076--f12586fcea84.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-and-uk-strike-landmark-deal-to-strengthen-ties-after-brexit/a-80001076?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The European Union and the United Kingdom have agreed on "landmark" deals on youth mobility and trade. Leaders on both sides praised the agreement as they seek to rebuild ties.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
